B.apd=s(["Ba\u011flant\u0131 kurulamad\u0131. Tekrar dener misin?","Couldn't connect. Try again?"],t.s)
B.aoA=s(["Biraz h\u0131zl\u0131 gittik \u2014 birka\xe7 dakika sonra tekrar dene.","That was quick \u2014 try again in a few minutes."],t.s)
B.ad4=s(["Bu plan i\xe7in bug\xfcnl\xfck yeterince de\u011fi\u015fiklik yapt\u0131k. Yeni bir plan ba\u015flatabilirsin.","That's enough changes to this plan for today. You can start a new plan."],t.s)
